# minimax-game — the 3D platformer project section
#
# The rule, the same one the Super Citycon section already uses: ONE copy of
# every asset. The library packs below are 2.5 GB of source archives that live
# in ~/.minimax/asset-library and are re-fetchable with
#   tools/fetch-3d-packs.sh
#   tools/fetch-remaining-3d.sh
# Committing them would put a second copy of every library asset in the history.

platformer-docs/library-packs/

# Generated indexes are derived from the packs above. They ARE committed
# (10 MB) because the design documents and verify_design.py cite them as the
# measured authority for asset paths, clip names and licences.

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
